Package: platereaderr
Title: Parse and Process Plate Reader OD Measurements
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Kristóf", "Koncz", email = "kristofkoncz2002@azet.sk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Imports and parses the raw OD measurements from the plate reader, 
  also splits the 384 well plate into 4 smaller 96 well paltes, and
  provide the standard additive layout to annontate the measurements.
